ASSISTANT: Looks like the scores in the Math course are not available for some students. Let me try to filter out the students who have no scores:
<function name="run_query">
<arg name="query">
SELECT students.id, students.name, students.gpa, enrollments.grade
FROM students
JOIN enrollments ON students.id = enrollments.student_id
JOIN courses ON enrollments.course_id = courses.id
WHERE courses.name = "Mathematics"
AND students.gpa < 2.5
AND enrollments.grade IS NOT NULL
ORDER BY enrollments.grade ASC  
LIMIT 3
</arg>
</function>

